  "name": "Tether",
  "description": "A cross-platform, provenance-first desktop suite for single-molecule FRET (smFRET) analysis: native movie-to-trace extraction, a trace-to-movie round-trip browser, per-condition machine-assisted curation, photophysical corrections, and HMM idealization via an isolated tMAVEN sidecar. Built for the Mondragón Lab, Northwestern University.",
